            %p and
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gromov-Witten+invariants"} Gromov-Witten invariants
            %p see there for background and context.
            %p
              This entry contains a basic introduction to
              = succeed "s" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+curve"} elliptic curve
              = succeed "s." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+space"} moduli space
          %p Previous:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+cohomology+theories"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - cohomology theories
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+formal+groups+and+cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - formal groups and cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+E-infinity+rings+and+derived+schemes"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - E-infinity rings and derived schemes
          %p Next:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology+-+equivariant+cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology - equivariant cohomology
          %blockquote
            %p
              the following are rough unpolished notes taken more or less verbatim from some seminar talk – needs attention, meaning:
              %strong somebody should go through this and polish
          %hr/
          %h1#contents Contents
          .maruku_toc
            %ul
              %li
                %a{:href => "#contents"} Contents
              %li
                %a{:href => "#elliptic_curves"} elliptic curves
              %li
                %a{:href => "#moduli_spaces_of_elliptic_curves"} moduli spaces of elliptic curves
              %li
                %a{:href => "#orbifolds"} orbifolds
              %li
                %a{:href => "#moduli_stackorbifold_of_elliptic_curves"} moduli stack/orbifold of elliptic curves
              %li
