          %h1#topological_invariants_of_the_moduli_stack topological invariants of the moduli stack
          %p
            Since the upper half plane is contractible, the homotopy type of
            %math#mathml_8d24bba2eaa7b67c110c19e681c5170b710a5bc6_153.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
